tter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783454030 -0400\n\nhotfix(code): fix failing unit tests (#4551)\n\nFixes three failing unit tests by bounding streamed JSON arg nesting\nbefore parsing, isolating the Tavily optional-tool test from user\nconfig, and making installer PATH profile detection deterministic in\ntests.","verified_at":"2026-07-07T19:53:51Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bd9bafaad3f51d426563aa24658bbb3a089d4825","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bd9bafaad3f51d426563aa24658bbb3a089d4825","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bd9bafaad3f51d426563aa24658bbb3a089d4825/comments","author":{"login":"imnishitha","id":32355027,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzU1MDI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32355027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha","html_url":"https://github.com/imnishitha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e9010c0958e4249a5c4a29c4bc1ba8542ff6d4ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e9010c0958e4249a5c4a29c4bc1ba8542ff6d4ac","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e9010c0958e4249a5c4a29c4bc1ba8542ff6d4ac"}]},{"sha":"e9010c0958e4249a5c4a29c4bc1ba8542ff6d4ac","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGU5MDEwYzA5NThlNDI0OWE1YzRhMjljNGJjMWJhODU0MmZmNmQ0YWM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nishitha M","email":"32355027+imnishitha@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-07T19:44:46Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-07T19:44:46Z"},"message":"hotfix(code): fix release runtime dependency test (#4550)\n\nThe deepagents-code release workflow installs the built wheel before\nrunning the checkout test suite. That makes\n`_runtime_package_dependency()` correctly resolve to the installed\nversion pin, but the unit test assumed the imported package always came\nfrom the source checkout.\n\nThis updates the source-checkout-specific assertion to mock\n`deepagents_code.__file__` to the checkout package path before calling\n`_runtime_package_dependency()`, keeping the test focused on the\npackage-root calculation without depending on how the package was\ninstalled in the test environment.","tree":{"sha":"c448d1c786dc7d2fcbd2d7c3153d3da5e4cfa1bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/c448d1c786dc7d2fcbd2d7c3153d3da5e4cfa1bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/e9010c0958e4249a5c4a29c4bc1ba8542ff6d4ac","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTVcuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsBcQAHpQuGAlSEj7DJ2RfK7iE3ff\nOH0/6N2wDfnajgggDL3BxQvfFyG0dh9xPlzAnNT2LCUHIT60VmK61Tn8ly5XwEW0\n2Hl67JPZ511FVTUrtai66nZB0OML9tXPECI/U1Dekj/FXfQU/3c9wp/JhLfeJFc3\nIw7SHpjoATmLgN3VwdjBbpfm2/r4E2/sXfAW1s58sUQjNwJJPr9T596sC+sEmzoc\nJFgTcMe53s+pG9SxYmBXrIPjKIqDKCVmwswZS9IWA0XiSbkUhxK7kxPGvS4Ef3OB\n5GDLNHWfNncvF6n1vcoKLEifYM2oEXr9PCUgB16EkzzU5InXtMOcq0eU+vj/thmr\nFZiwKTSKIPJ6hcJx6N+mIEeMcewOySxUxPrsj6AAr7DW9HqZ+z1iJZ35rjrVoIiI\nfdAVXVoNXFVkliQ7kXdwehpZaElxS1Aepx+n7Ib99KoNNc+bC2voqgd7gTJqKITe\naxQkcuEadWK7kj73QFC2u4jnifFRnmwQ56V5uGrZDB1+6TVZePR+E0GgTBITC1hi\n1oDB8HFAXfod3x7T+s8gIIVVZpSv367oa0TSP/AVuKDQ0qW/XNnuD/ldMy9xB/Is\nYJ5BdSRuJS72AYkfZjjFuyNPMjCkQs17Qpn7YloJiRLDTrcYffUKrnjkr1Ho9vRy\nI+DYnAF5IxZXsIA7tvis\n=1nt2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c448d1c786dc7d2fcbd2d7c3153d3da5e4cfa1bd\nparent ad6ae52cb6ff0626c1c5f79728abb2db9ba5cd29\nauthor Nishitha M <32355027+imnishitha@users.noreply.github.com> 1783453486 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783453486 -0400\n\nhotfix(code): fix release runtime dependency test (#4550)\n\nThe deepagents-code release workflow installs the built wheel before\nrunning the checkout test suite. That makes\n`_runtime_package_dependency()` correctly resolve to the installed\nversion pin, but the unit test assumed the imported package always came\nfrom the source checkout.\n\nThis updates the source-checkout-specific assertion to mock\n`deepagents_code.__file__` to the checkout package path before calling\n`_runtime_package_dependency()`, keeping the test focused on the\npackage-root calculation without depending on how the package was\ninstalled in the test environment.","verified_at":"2026-07-07T19:44:47Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e9010c0958e4249a5c4a29c4bc1ba8542ff6d4ac","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e9010c0958e4249a5c4a29c4bc1ba8542ff6d4ac","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e9010c0958e4249a5c4a29c4bc1ba8542ff6d4ac/comments","author":{"login":"imnishitha","id":32355027,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzU1MDI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32355027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha","html_url":"https://github.com/imnishitha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ad6ae52cb6ff0626c1c5f79728abb2db9ba5cd29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ad6ae52cb6ff0626c1c5f79728abb2db9ba5cd29","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ad6ae52cb6ff0626c1c5f79728abb2db9ba5cd29"}]},{"sha":"ad6ae52cb6ff0626c1c5f79728abb2db9ba5cd29","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGFkNmFlNTJjYjZmZjA2MjZjMWM1Zjc5NzI4YWJiMmRiOWJhNWNkMjk","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-07T19:31:34Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-07T19:31:34Z"},"message":"release(deepagents-code): 0.1.34 (#4537)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.34](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.33...deepagents-code==0.1.34)\n(2026-07-07)\n\n### Features\n\n* Nemotron 3 Ultra harness profile via [SDK\nbump](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/releases/tag/deepagents%3D%3D0.7.0a6)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Show `(local)` tag under ANSI themes\n([#4534](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4534))\n([699e439](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/699e439699723e477a621f95eef87a7d76aac5f5))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"c2e1d77d34cc1e504034fbab466ea542b7f01c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/c2e1d77d34cc1e504034fbab466ea542b7f01c65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ad6ae52cb6ff0626c1c5f79728abb2db9ba5cd29","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTVQWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABNkQAE8Nq4JSx5Pjr4puRPfog0NB\ntFuIW1NoPrpT3r9cfDimyfdB/Vyj+HgpKEZotcIUp/GtljYTBArEuRaOLrxknLkl\nE6rKn2J0FtsUfoXtjZzH+Xsy19U7EDm5ZZVAYywzuy0wRQ2JLBXLIvbOgtdXDeg7\nv9Qsc98cDlIAt8+EzrWpRbXmU9VQbtrlv9BwF7O4+k+PRfdJKTnoJ6zf2sw5LXGL\n1XaAu2KMibeDthAp1T7rtY/D0gidcthNOJ9H/M603jUpGp5di0cjlGhEdjED/I/i\ntbaRe16bRBlbxEISr/bIla5ekaiB45Lq6jkEdO5lEOtuXiGtqn093HDSjmwDAJbB\nTp1GJGq/VsJTlItjHM2HtPHELs8NoMgqavoiWrT2b07SYz3Z0Bq9cN2hi8bwQ3WV\noTj+tI2U/LzJtZv6Nt3hIfJGQjQoCmwp4UHnDLdV7UCGp50+xp57LYTkLdJ1ZjQa\nEkPIY1UnE92Msc2NZG+Jrpo1pnkJKoeQS3kGpAV1uB9yk0MvXV7wsihROkesWsls\nS7DjuFYLFkoUWpRbQkGXONCDsUN1YLcFaAjzFeo0hEEv3K5sRYp+49bt3eIlyfHO\n6eRb1BJuGY4omj4Y8eTX2Wo+n7d8GQwO8zsxhJAuuJsgeAg7geMVvc8IanMVCfDc\nemHuVZgwz8VmfJULKC6z\n=mKyl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c2e1d77d34cc1e504034fbab466ea542b7f01c65\nparent 586f53dbe12c8521a8e3e4a27da9a0786d21b77e\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1783452694 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783452694 -0400\n\nrelease(deepagents-code): 0.1.34 (#4537)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.34](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.33...deepagents-code==0.1.34)\n(2026-07-07)\n\n### Features\n\n* Nemotron 3 Ultra harness profile via [SDK\nbump](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/releases/tag/deepagents%3D%3D0.7.0a6)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Show `(local)` tag under ANSI themes\n([#4534](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4534))\n([699e439](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/699e439699723e477a621f95eef87a7d76aac5f5))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-07-07T19:31:34Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ad6ae52cb6ff0626c1c5f79728abb2db9ba5cd29","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ad6ae52cb6ff0626c1c5f79728abb2db9ba5cd29","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ad6ae52cb6ff0626c1c5f79728abb2db9ba5cd29/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.gith