gljzESGeVeyW\nl/tk8Dtl0n56Z3Vq+lFyNTMDWBagaye9iXtf/UPAHK4AR7pS/ydW0N5EsLac5b27\n/zbksJsrzWE6hOKE+WKHGbbw7E+bsAnLx7J/NpYnp03NRd+/Xh4HlOCWAl4yw9Cd\nkiKpL0qQQohfJsJsllUvQq+WEFIpT+rJVfb7TpaM4l7czkH/ko+qmnP8W/luWVK8\nbeB6Yv7cCkIU2pTaQ5wui09DgR+YiUSFNrdzkr1Z4sZ9hdSyespeias7IZAGmbKq\nFlBiqvec9PFGwDynPEIikMr9ELMvDfrZDxQvu0ARQ1XifTBBpQwPzcJpNthf/Vyv\n+dA6YbMrQBClTQWp6A9U\n=ZmVy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 601e14932717c77264da1400967a46d3e328e5af\nparent cbdb0a7df8cd4bbacff9ca7ac2e42232ef290c10\nauthor Ryan Kraus <rmkraus@users.noreply.github.com> 1783448826 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783448826 -0400\n\nfix(acp): defer interrupt state reads until stream closes (#4542)","verified_at":"2026-07-07T18:27:07Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/35199ab22b2111474d1f46b3ad7cc677d82ed46b","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/35199ab22b2111474d1f46b3ad7cc677d82ed46b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/35199ab22b2111474d1f46b3ad7cc677d82ed46b/comments","author":{"login":"rmkraus","id":4956442,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTY0NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4956442?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus","html_url":"https://github.com/rmkraus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rmkraus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"cbdb0a7df8cd4bbacff9ca7ac2e42232ef290c10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/cbdb0a7df8cd4bbacff9ca7ac2e42232ef290c10","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/cbdb0a7df8cd4bbacff9ca7ac2e42232ef290c10"}]},{"sha":"cbdb0a7df8cd4bbacff9ca7ac2e42232ef290c10","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGNiZGIwYTdkZjhjZDRiYmFjZmY5Y2E3YWMyZTQyMjMyZWYyOTBjMTA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-07T16:42:20Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-07T16:42:20Z"},"message":"fix(sdk): isolate composite glob paths (#4531)\n\nFixes #4510\n\nCorrected `CompositeBackend.glob/aglob` so explicit default-backend\npaths no longer include results from routed backends.\n\n---\n\n`CompositeBackend` routes file operations by path prefix. `grep`/`agrep`\nalready handle the three routing cases correctly:\n\n- Route-scoped paths like `/memories/` search only the routed backend.\n- Root and unscoped searches (`path=\"/\"` or `path=None`) aggregate the\ndefault backend plus all routed backends.\n- Explicit paths that do not match a route, like `/tools`, search only\nthe default backend.\n\n`glob`/`aglob` handled route-scoped searches correctly, but unmatched\nexplicit paths fell through to the aggregate branch. That meant a search\nscoped to `/tools` could incorrectly return matching files from\n`/memories`.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Updated `CompositeBackend.glob` and `CompositeBackend.aglob` to mirror\nthe existing `grep` / `agrep` routing rules.\n- Preserved root and unscoped aggregation across the default backend and\nrouted backends.\n- Preserved route-scoped glob behavior, including remapping result paths\nback under the route prefix.\n- Added sync and async regression coverage for the issue repro:\n`glob(\"*.md\", path=\"/tools\")` returns `/tools/hammer.md` and does not\nreturn `/memories/secret.md`.\n\n## User story\n\nAs a Deep Agents user with `CompositeBackend` routing `/memories/` to a\nseparate backend, I expect a scoped glob like `glob(\"*.md\",\npath=\"/tools\")` to search only `/tools` in the default backend. Files\nfrom routed paths, such as `/memories/secret.md`, should only appear\nwhen I explicitly search that route, search `/`, or run an unscoped\nglob.","tree":{"sha":"d8687cfa74cfaffa5e19a3b4fca1f281c73c987e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/d8687cfa74cfaffa5e19a3b4fca1f281c73c987e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/cbdb0a7df8cd4bbacff9ca7ac2e42232ef290c10","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTSxsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaFkQABwBKA5KiZ11pUNrs3O7wu+F\nF1er3yTOHHn1JENW+ZXWRTqh5Husjx8J2kZmheiXbyZYj3ZDElEeT+KINj8riSUy\nzaiZaJDFSiDnq84fvSvclVHgi/m7sFK58WOBZ59dKbTELFWH/J6c47kkuGMJzcQG\nujR41QrCTfBgZXINWkOfuEPzfcgaoarWDQ5DMcjI29udc5jdL10bAviJJrIODW/2\nroIoTl6bu1VweCGlVMN4SLOxRbt4KqCwX8LzyUe94luV6mX8Vz/NMjkJO5EIDY/0\nTFggS/Z8RDced8vn60UNc+YaPNnJSBRF9xc2/j5JOclvZNlfqagGKF9AvWoXBZ0B\n7MfDbRpTEQNgMSZKc1uXWQfylpSD9f09amYr7K7eRSu+NjXtScLmiMIukrf8v8Cj\newQOy2iex+OnViTs9iRzLtAtcxCW3z30yUGDKhOZokjyKYL6NdCRA7+pOFvS6MJd\nPap4LcCGoJqME2XkPK96u2OCWjSF1Hldq826jSJH8jqo4Vdhmc8y96R9x3CJqUdI\nsYl/Zlg8pLHo9IIVg/LZCR1sNZakbAUf5as5F+THC1VFJVeGDdsCCs4hRpa+YiGg\nGzX17o69h8B7hoc662VTlhX5XcLCxcK2Zy6TiQk7xhbnc0OgPV7NLRSGF1FB0VHU\nuAGPeK7A0mDp4YvfsFWs\n=g3TW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree d8687cfa74cfaffa5e19a3b4fca1f281c73c987e\nparent 7be76c752117e6e61dcdc931ea5147261fad6768\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783442540 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783442540 -0400\n\nfix(sdk): isolate composite glob paths (#4531)\n\nFixes #4510\n\nCorrected `CompositeBackend.glob/aglob` so explicit default-backend\npaths no longer include results from routed backends.\n\n---\n\n`CompositeBackend` routes file operations by path prefix. `grep`/`agrep`\nalready handle the three routing cases correctly:\n\n- Route-scoped paths like `/memories/` search only the routed backend.\n- Root and unscoped searches (`path=\"/\"` or `path=None`) aggregate the\ndefault backend plus all routed backends.\n- Explicit paths that do not match a route, like `/tools`, search only\nthe default backend.\n\n`glob`/`aglob` handled route-scoped searches correctly, but unmatched\nexplicit paths fell through to the aggregate branch. That meant a search\nscoped to `/tools` could incorrectly return matching files from\n`/memories`.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Updated `CompositeBackend.glob` and `CompositeBackend.aglob` to mirror\nthe existing `grep` / `agrep` routing rules.\n- Preserved root and unscoped aggregation across the default backend and\nrouted backends.\n- Preserved route-scoped glob behavior, including remapping result paths\nback under the route prefix.\n- Added sync and async regression coverage for the issue repro:\n`glob(\"*.md\", path=\"/tools\")` returns `/tools/hammer.md` and does not\nreturn `/memories/secret.md`.\n\n## User story\n\nAs a Deep Agents user with `CompositeBackend` routing `/memories/` to a\nseparate backend, I expect a scoped glob like `glob(\"*.md\",\npath=\"/tools\")` to search only `/tools` in the default backend. Files\nfrom routed paths, such as `/memories/secret.md`, should only appear\nwhen I explicitly search that route, search `/`, or run an unscoped\nglob.","verified_at":"2026-07-07T16:42:20Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/cbdb0a7df8cd4bbacff9ca7ac2e42232ef290c10","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/cbdb0a7df8cd4bbacff9ca7ac2e42232ef290c10","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/cbdb0a7df8cd4bbacff9ca7ac2e42232ef290c10/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"7be76c752117e6e61dcdc931ea5147261fad6768","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7be76c752117e6e61dcdc931ea5147261fad6768","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7be76c752117e6e61dcdc931ea5147261fad6768"}]},{"sha":"7be76c752117e6e61dcdc931ea5147261fad6768","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDdiZTc2Yzc1MjExN2U2ZTYxZGNkYzkzMWVhNTE0NzI2MWZhZDY3Njg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-07T01:11:14Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-07T01:11:14Z"},"message":"fix(sdk): preserve `ContextT` on `create_deep_agent` `middleware` (#4055)\n\nCloses #4051\n\n---\n\n`create_deep_agent` declared its `middleware` parameter as a bare\n`Sequence[AgentMiddleware]`. That pins `ContextT` to `None`, so type\ncheckers reject context-aware middleware such as\n`AgentMiddleware[AgentState, Context]` even when a matching\n`context_schema` is passed.\n\nPR #2383 threaded `ContextT` through `context_schema` and the return\ntype but missed `middleware`. This types it as\n`Sequence[AgentMiddleware[StateT_co, ContextT]]`, mirroring upstream\n`langchain.agents.create_agent`, so the inferred context type is\npreserved. `StateT_co` is imported from\n`langchain.agents.middleware.types`.\n\nA type-level regression test runs `ty` over a fixture that passes a\ncontext-aware middleware alongside `context_schema`; it fails against\nthe previous bare annotation.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/305e0718-361a-e13b-6940-8cb55cb29dee)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"263a6f002128bd11a50d53524085638d0c5df8c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/263a6f002128bd11a50d53524085638d0c5df8c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/7be76c752117e6e61dcdc931ea5147261fad6768","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTFIyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUlYQACVP++d3jjJ7iBkGcztU2e19\nb41yjLJu26CdxRzBlwirJsTYDc5f49cZ1N/ey5x3Qx0LtXEIuPlZcGq8O8lzq/FV\nBL/y37ccO7eV5sNRGR0VAasAVQcLTViFQIiOY+4itUdoxVjCooJ38IOao3qpKv3u\naYEmUAZWKi6yFfzQYZFuQDYATeL0UGTe3Jl3O+evK09A161RKEg8CcHuIRbNNOhi\nQyDr1dZtEuY+KgAvVylrojLP1gEVEBljn32yxme9cWjKqJM7EFY4IqHsRRWd8hnv\nzKSMN0eL4ZNrS12z3Fm97SJTMr2LK+ZzfdPEvXWTUP+7nbZai/qbWujK0XRwcdzW\n+Ff3kV8CKb+AYPC6rfTE+5d+kppX/AUTTg/ljXNuc1yJXQjl2WKDVud9/VUV5xBf\n9Q4fPQ3DdboxicddigoXNj3w7eJKQ12qa+W0ewXTN9QxpazOArNP4acepoOHWmrh\nQOgU0RyU/FxgswiRDssDtnwv6IamGUQgBw1+8rX6/Z+0xMqhojMTCDfHv1wEOvVd\nrV2veLNI4fdunsk+kDthwRfUwi67LvO0ZT6mxxWvsp7GhARe/jT7LRQDEGoCeyGg\nJTMO6VD8brpX/BhcoBDfMLLQZ/jEJX9FEc48R7DqDF/u3X2JkiLwKNfs4XFjrXyF\n8WP0CTzzqf3VzmTrQ/lT\n=R8Ti\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 263a6f002128bd11a50d53524085638d0c5df8c1\nparent 5c47bdbdda889693fa060bc30b6b486d0f0e0bcf\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783386674 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783386674 -0400\n\nfix(sdk): preserve `ContextT` on `create_deep_agent` `middleware` (#4055)\n\nCloses #4051\n\n---\n\n`create_deep_agent` declared its `middleware` parameter as a bare\n`Sequence[AgentMiddleware]`. That pins `ContextT` to `None`, so type\ncheckers reject context-aware middleware such as\n`AgentMiddleware[AgentState, Context]` even when a matching\n`context_schema` is passed.\n\nPR #2383 threaded `ContextT` through `context_schema` and the return\ntype but missed `middleware`. This types it as\n`Sequence[AgentMiddleware[StateT_co, ContextT]]`, mirroring upstream\n`langchain.agents.create_agent`, so the inferred context type is\npreserved. `StateT_co` is imported from\n`langchain.agents.middleware.types`.\n\nA type-level regression test runs `ty` over a fixture that passes a\ncontext-aware middleware alongside `context_schema`; it fails against\nthe previous bare annotation.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/305e0718-361a-e13b-6940-8cb55cb29dee)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-07T01:11:15Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7be76c752117e6e61dcdc931ea5147261fad6768","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7be76c752117e6e61dcdc931ea5147261fad6768","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7be76c752117e6e61dcdc931ea5147261fad6768/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"5c47bdbdda889693fa060bc30b6b486d0f0e0bcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5c47bdbdda889693fa060bc30b6b486d0f0e0bcf","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/5c47bdbdda889693fa060bc30b6b486d0f0e0bcf"}]},{"sha":"5c47bdbdda889693fa060bc30b6b486d0f0e0bcf","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDVjNDdiZGJkZGE4ODk2OTNmYTA2MGJjMzBiNmI0ODZkMGYwZTBiY2Y","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-06T23:01:21Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-06T23:01:21Z"},"message":"release(deepagents-talon): 0.0.3 (#4429)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.0.3](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-talon==0.0.2...deepagents-talon==0.0.3)\n(2026-07-06)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **sdk:** optional video frame extraction on `read_file`\n([#4094](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4094))\n([b927147](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b927147d026749c6c790bb06c9853515dabf579c))\n* **talon:** add Fleet zip import command\n([#4493](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4493))\n([0289dd0](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0289dd0a190e5060e631e840da115dd59c64cf5c))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **talon:** materialize agents under home\n([f2b26a8](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f2b26a8915fb70c26d32af6e8240442e5e6118e6))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1272a4c611587bf5295960b962602e043353eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/f1272a4c611587bf5295960b962602e043353eda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/5c47bdbdda889693fa060bc30b6b486d0f0e0bcf","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTDPBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcgwQACif/kfXzgdsI0u/XP2KutoJ\nbU9qTdeC5IVE26amdmvf3yRnek3PoEsJMgEdvNju/rOdiB3G1qr9ddNfNVYXoXdi\niIcS7/2DSEPe2PrCWlpHKZzLhuVfha3yFEZR+I96zbblN8zVC4j661+AHmG7TmU0\nIj0FMAjVQ/yRuO6bBpG0Ry+33GBJ+OTWwiDbdmacE9Rsztc7OwF5z1AXp2ab9ouN\n7gB1SceL/U59yFpo7gF5l8uvN8NJVLRY2lZGpSVBODO/andOpd6/5lxNNgyRgVuI\n+F8OFZMFPWGvrgg5s+BR3gXfgCai4wonUR