isabled by user (F2 to re-enable).`\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/dffdbedb-8544-790e-1312-42984fbc7684)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"76ec34bbc57ef10adf2fe834e547343bb91598e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/76ec34bbc57ef10adf2fe834e547343bb91598e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/59a665f339fd18aa47bc7bb7be7e685b6948e342","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqScCpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOCgQADnLB1JvrlvDDk+7smoUD7wQ\nKgA6DUeK8ZDPT4xFBKpdFn8Y3vtIybWjN8UHZ93d5J2ip+agb3eDyxMoF05fj5J4\nl85+VX1tKlYzAQTodxDlGjrnvY8TUDqe4/M/WAWTSXSrldlcFGHfWoRDrmF4i3O6\nV3vJ83kemHiBdTsk8FyK1A2YEJCqduQqFfn15lkUDmnLEYvZ1KnGfCJCtQsK8esA\n/ftJ3t2ryGhrWuj2damyhVBOpie7RaxNFS+wVqPbMr8MT+VPrMZoBdEqdoJ2ilF/\nPIt9Z0cHUyMt7FPVKFpXxaRWM5ds4xXdoslBa6MMp5frW664d2Gjec0YuMDjHQKr\nw5v5C1Xho/dHkcnzJUHtJv1Prk2KLbigb1WrX9o9MfTqBtqFpxKOWlKue+6AmF24\ngyN7qYnq4JoIYF/dboEhdCqRftcM+Uk0kc1j0sMVeaQaRYmkEiKwa2fMuZLD8clJ\npam2EI5aaufg4ZgahDSLDf6q1dYo0j53EShu1VAsHItgoNHURK55IercuKSEtzba\n18P3m4Dgd8i0bRYpV7ixpmbJruPPP6lQMn8MfSGGjsXXCX6eMLvJzRq5fARudUS4\nenrDRSyYIZ7/3eHQ9NZVfsSJ4+GtRYhtYL2cVP2fXPgLyBy9yA4jp2fw4UsrI/9T\nvrFc/P1heIhAgxMfXd5+\n=DgrA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 76ec34bbc57ef10adf2fe834e547343bb91598e4\nparent bdd4f1e014e04f295a269575f2fd89acbae55629\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783218345 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783218345 -0400\n\nstyle(code): drop redundant `/mcp` reference in disabled-server message (#4501)\n\nThe disabled-server status in the `/mcp` viewer read `Disabled by user\n(`/mcp` F2 to re-enable).`, but the user is already inside the `/mcp`\nswitcher when they see it, so mentioning `/mcp` is redundant. Now reads\n`Disabled by user (F2 to re-enable).`\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/dffdbedb-8544-790e-1312-42984fbc7684)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-05T02:25:45Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/59a665f339fd18aa47bc7bb7be7e685b6948e342","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/59a665f339fd18aa47bc7bb7be7e685b6948e342","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/59a665f339fd18aa47bc7bb7be7e685b6948e342/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"bdd4f1e014e04f295a269575f2fd89acbae55629","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bdd4f1e014e04f295a269575f2fd89acbae55629","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bdd4f1e014e04f295a269575f2fd89acbae55629"}]},{"sha":"bdd4f1e014e04f295a269575f2fd89acbae55629","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGJkZDRmMWUwMTRlMDRmMjk1YTI2OTU3NWYyZmQ4OWFjYmFlNTU2Mjk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-05T01:29:56Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-05T01:29:56Z"},"message":"chore(code): add `--help`/`--version` flags and verify uv installer download (#4503)\n\nThe `dcode` install script now supports `--help`/`-h` and\n`--version`/`-v` flags, and the uv installer download is verified before\nexecution to guard against non-shell responses from proxies or captive\nportals.\n\n## Release note\n\n- `curl -LsSf https://langch.in/dcode | bash -s -- --help` now prints a\nfull usage reference (all environment variables, valid extras, and a\ndocs link) and exits 0 without touching the network. `--version`/`-v`\nprints the installer version string and exits 0. Unknown flags (e.g. a\ntypo like `--verison`) are rejected with a non-zero exit and an\nactionable message instead of silently proceeding to a full install.\n- The uv bootstrap no longer pipes the downloader directly into `sh`. It\ndownloads the installer to a tempfile first, verifies the first line is\na shell shebang, and only then executes it. A 200 response containing\nHTML from a transparent proxy or captive portal is caught and rejected\nwith a clear error before it can reach `sh`.\n- On a failed download, the downloader's own stderr (curl DNS errors,\nTLS failures, HTTP status) is now surfaced to the user alongside the\ngeneric failure message, instead of being discarded.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added a CLI-flag loop at the top of `install.sh` that handles\n`--help`/`-h` (prints a `print_help` reference of all env vars and valid\nextras), `--version`/`-v` (prints `INSTALLER_VERSION`), and rejects\nunknown flags with exit code 2 — all before any install work begins.\n- Rewrote `install_uv` to download the uv installer to a tempfile via\n`curl -o` / `wget -O` (capturing the downloader's stderr) instead of\npiping directly to `sh`. On download failure, the captured stderr is\nprinted before the generic error. On success, the script's first line is\nchecked for a shell shebang (`^#!.*(sh|bash)`) before execution; a\nnon-shell response exits with an actionable message.\n- Updated the `media` extra in the env-var documentation within the help\ntext (was previously listed only as `quickjs` under standalone\nintegrations).\n- Added unit tests covering: `--help`/`-h` output and early exit,\n`--version`/`-v` output and early exit, unknown-flag rejection, shebang\nverification rejection (HTML response), download-failure error\nsurfacing, and the wget download path with verbose output.","tree":{"sha":"7574a5d56a8a91555850e2f2d30f16a22822a9f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/7574a5d56a8a91555850e2f2d30f16a22822a9f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/bdd4f1e014e04f295a269575f2fd89acbae55629","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSbOUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFcgQAKYekJqGDzYxyLpX/rfcnt47\nvYI2846o7YiQ0Z+Y2keEqYyjC+iUCzoqH/IufuOGpH0Xs4XbJ+SFLtHXGScPNAO9\na+tDSl6eos9aZpWTMPzNVWZ5k7DwR2XaBF8S1FOKdI02NrE28kk1AKMaY0QyZQVT\nic0XNYD1DBozqJV0oYpojM6q1eQ3974/5i/LfLKIvBF4us24f73T85RgitgJUcOP\nNovGPyF/SQw/md5knEXGfQkV41BoLpspL8dm6bZ/y7Ebq18EkL+zjyECOxd5nPPl\n5bqZ2ytfH0Z2+SjDx0s52SplOwRTku1ts6cGrhmn27vwlVacJA5RP6mvOAXTba5d\nC6r24HTMNtks8DjBjwcPg6DTiKSwMdR9wW2+b1+stCMtM7AQoFQiF1iiWc9OOC7r\nBlbpy6fx7H/U8H8jQSeiGnA+LX1JvolLKVc44yE3FG2hGJdGWuHX8FvkALLBEttp\nZiX8zqVboE4mYPnHGIznuZgwTHjHhiSB5nIp/l/fwwjc6UjsC4tn90PyhNe9hnR+\nl0WNue7mjJbzwx+70oY6SAoIWCjHxe1SO9mMIkGEwISPlKG32mHMXxIXFCsAQFpL\nEXQPUv+H2vHKTeCeE8w3VdoNXe9XsRYQbRi/F2TK1b7/f0YNWWKGsZ1ovCXTjple\nCyoC3Wn+MRS5MgufmZoG\n=XF1g\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 7574a5d56a8a91555850e2f2d30f16a22822a9f5\nparent bf5e551399565136e35628e046e0ad6cede6df3f\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783214996 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783214996 -0400\n\nchore(code): add `--help`/`--version` flags and verify uv installer download (#4503)\n\nThe `dcode` install script now supports `--help`/`-h` and\n`--version`/`-v` flags, and the uv installer download is verified before\nexecution to guard against non-shell responses from proxies or captive\nportals.\n\n## Release note\n\n- `curl -LsSf https://langch.in/dcode | bash -s -- --help` now prints a\nfull usage reference (all environment variables, valid extras, and a\ndocs link) and exits 0 without touching the network. `--version`/`-v`\nprints the installer version string and exits 0. Unknown flags (e.g. a\ntypo like `--verison`) are rejected with a non-zero exit and an\nactionable message instead of silently proceeding to a full install.\n- The uv bootstrap no longer pipes the downloader directly into `sh`. It\ndownloads the installer to a tempfile first, verifies the first line is\na shell shebang, and only then executes it. A 200 response containing\nHTML from a transparent proxy or captive portal is caught and rejected\nwith a clear error before it can reach `sh`.\n- On a failed download, the downloader's own stderr (curl DNS errors,\nTLS failures, HTTP status) is now surfaced to the user alongside the\ngeneric failure message, instead of being discarded.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added a CLI-flag loop at the top of `install.sh` that handles\n`--help`/`-h` (prints a `print_help` reference of all env vars and valid\nextras), `--version`/`-v` (prints `INSTALLER_VERSION`), and rejects\nunknown flags with exit code 2 — all before any install work begins.\n- Rewrote `install_uv` to download the uv installer to a tempfile via\n`curl -o` / `wget -O` (capturing the downloader's stderr) instead of\npiping directly to `sh`. On download failure, the captured stderr is\nprinted before the generic error. On success, the script's first line is\nchecked for a shell shebang (`^#!.*(sh|bash)`) before execution; a\nnon-shell response exits with an actionable message.\n- Updated the `media` extra in the env-var documentation within the help\ntext (was previously listed only as `quickjs` under standalone\nintegrations).\n- Added unit tests covering: `--help`/`-h` output and early exit,\n`--version`/`-v` output and early exit, unknown-flag rejection, shebang\nverification rejection (HTML response), download-failure error\nsurfacing, and the wget download path with verbose output.","verified_at":"2026-07-05T01:29:56Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bdd4f1e014e04f295a269575f2fd89acbae55629","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bdd4f1e014e04f295a269575f2fd89acbae55629","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bdd4f1e014e04f295a269575f2fd89acbae55629/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"bf5e551399565136e35628e046e0ad6cede6df3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bf5e551399565136e35628e046e0ad6cede6df3f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bf5e551399565136e35628e046e0ad6cede6df3f"}]},{"sha":"bf5e551399565136e35628e046e0ad6cede6df3f","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGJmNWU1NTEzOTk1NjUxMzZlMzU2MjhlMDQ2ZTBhZDZjZWRlNmRmM2Y","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-03T21:17:33Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-03T21:17:33Z"},"message":"docs(repo): mention `dcode` command in root `AGENTS.md` (#4480)\n\n## Description\nThe root `AGENTS.md` referenced `deepagents-code` and \"Deep Agents Code\"\nbut never named the `dcode` console command an agent actually runs. This\nadds a one-line note in the Deep Agents Code section clarifying that\n`dcode` is the short alias for `deepagents-code`, so repo context can\nresolve what `dcode` is without spelunking `libs/code`.\n\n## Release Note\nnone\n\n## Test Plan\n- [ ] N/A — documentation-only change.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/b568e22c-6998-7a9b-944f-3a9ca43ac276)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5e1c40d307a7d5253a78fd2d42f8e32cf01a656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/b5e1c40d307a7d5253a78fd2d42f8e32cf01a656"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/bf5e551399565136e35628e046e0ad6cede6df3f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSCbtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHCMQAF7V7QnrjyMOFHz7nJc1LD3y\nrmU4zggNStkW1MnFTb1pP/IX1gNDWztdbyQcIljlEcnLtPs6KTG14uW6BmFj22cN\nHjHvyhp/msH7yqWIvIeO/M1w3blEwtKTnHE0kPz0Yo6ebmKi7NI3myWONjQIuez7\n5p1AX+eSdqQGrWdkswV4NHLu9RPQp/QdcK6U7wvESZNaCgF9rKeplZ2BCG9odSbQ\ns1Sk6vmkP2PUUKLD0Vp0HS71YFIMLgFWxph47yrpHimt0oC5qyYsxceTOWGGID81\nyRoQF3U7E08D7nmB7Fhk2wou1bPBxvq8rfjwdPN9KFYV4hnLiOstK9n25q9Dyxv0\nHUtGZiIg2HOWXLwdpyIZ29I8oG4LZiHMoNaQiXCBDDnEvz3QiC/WDEH9KajjVIFo\nqg7943VMBmcd9J0abDFVvGCPx/XA1l17iRdZdlSR9hNR21mv2dA99yHLFcJOlzgJ\naiUaCbPznxDOZ7Zml/XtCbeHtCHiUqxhNun5OSfyBL6N2ytga104LGqmUA+Poz5O\ncLpRSN2oHEHF2idfbzurUSqAVGVuKHvaya8VTueEKq/Pce5BzS0hUc45/HdIAJ3l\nYZB1fV44jJT/Jh3rCZVZTTsX6nDcGNVBG7P9k0u4UtyCJIhw7Vj0yfFiagD6gc+D\nRqs3ZEhXZ622QCO523Gh\n=zvey\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b5e1c40d307a7d5253a78fd2d42f8e32cf01a656\nparent aa9ccc620133c325a72e552546d5d6ff10649407\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783113453 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783113453 -0400\n\ndocs(repo): mention `dcode` command in root `AGENTS.md` (#4480)\n\n## Description\nThe root `AGENTS.md` referenced `deepagents-code` and \"Deep Agents Code\"\nbut never named the `dcode` console command an agent actually runs. This\nadds a one-line note in the Deep Agents Code section clarifying that\n`dcode` is the short alias for `deepagents-code`, so repo context can\nresolve what `dcode` is without spelunking `libs/code`.\n\n## Release Note\nnone\n\n## Test Plan\n- [ ] N/A — documentation-only change.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/b568e22c-6998-7a9b-944f-3a9ca43ac276)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-03T21:17:33Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bf5e551399565136e35628e046e0ad6cede6df3f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bf5e551399565136e35628e046e0ad6cede6df3f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bf5e551399565136e35628e046e0ad6cede6df3f/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"aa9ccc620133c325a72e552546d5d6ff10649407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/aa9ccc620133c325a72e552546d5d6ff10649407","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/aa9ccc620133c325a72e552546d5d6ff10649407"}]},{"sha":"aa9ccc620133c325a72e552546d5d6ff10649407","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGFhOWNjYzYyMDEzM2MzMjVhNzJlNTUyNTQ2ZDVkNmZmMTA2NDk0MDc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-03T06:30:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-03T06:30:02Z"},"message":"chore(code): automatic PATH setup, snap-curl detection, and temp cleanup in install script (#4464)\n\nThe installer now actively fixes `dcode` PATH resolution instead of just\nwarning the user, detects snap-sandboxed `curl` that silently fails\ndownloads, and cleans up temp files on Ctrl-C without printing a\ncontradictory failure message.\n\n## Changes\n- **Automatic PATH setup** — `ensure_path_setup` symlinks the verified\nbinary into an existing PATH dir (`~/.local/bin`, `~/bin`, `~/.bin`); if\nnone are on PATH, creates `~/.local/bin`, symlinks there, and appends a\nPATH export to the detected shell profile (`.zshrc`, `.bashrc`,\n`.bash_profile`, `config.fish`). Prompts interactively before modifying\na profile, auto-adds in non-interactive mode, and skips entirely when\nuv's `~/.local/bin/env` already handles PATH.\n- **Snap `curl` detection** — `is_snap_curl` checks whether `curl` lives\nunder `/snap/`, in which case it has sandbox permission issues that\ncause silent download failures. `install_uv` and the new\n`download_to_stdout` helper fall back to `wget`, or emit a clear error\nif no working downloader exists.\n- **Interrupt-safe temp cleanup** — a `TEMP_FILES` registry\n(`register_temp` / `cleanup_temp_files`) tracks every `mktemp` so\nthey're removed on both normal exit and Ctrl-C. A dedicated\n`cleanup_on_interrupt` handler for INT/TERM disarms the EXIT trap first,\nso the user sees only \"Installation interrupted.\" rather than that\nfollowed by a contradictory \"Installation failed (exit code 1).\"\n- **`download_to_stdout` helper** — consolidates the duplicated\ncurl-or-wget logic from `install_uv` and `fetch_latest_version` into one\nfunction with snap detection built in.","tree":{"sha":"6fa1d331288bf5dd158ebefeb96f734d4f058d4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/6fa1d331288bf5dd158ebefeb96f734d4f058d4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/aa9ccc620133c325a72e552546d5d6ff10649407","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqR1bqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdKkQAEmvHY+Xma7GxGXnhVusE3u8\nskx5wg3R/N175FQfZRIOb4c8EDrqnV50+2YpXe8KbO2D2GhnhYJ2w3Rb/nTkfqqe\nbUOQF+AZOrMPPL3E5XwMoheJY48M93JGnTqabbY3HOAwUjLxQnO4xLGMDq2GQnEv\nvNgMUAufwfbMQ2KGxQo4dwkEVKcKs7bygNVJNNh9tdeKtabNW35fDGRfjNsbAaRJ\nO0OmHWZ7sWYLzeS+k4fNQNSv+NqDE+sqahtAmme+SiTQ+T2Q2kRDd52+72LnRUOt\nsoCwk3HU4CfpyBB9kEgurB+WEEuVcYaTv9u3PdaFAzRGgHvQ0GhyiO39Np4P2n37\negoxftC3cIRnfpWQ8bISAXTT9awrrArOGl+EuTAAT5hBCcdF2rb/ZBxJSWZqK/vN\nxs5e0OltDPBThJdVIVZnzoGJbhr2j2p8L5ceXJrEC051mQbZvoO8g625wuiH+PjN\n2E98in6diOKlgIJLIEk9IJJ8QSbvL26uxa/b0XFFr1WbP6Whuc+KGzenJ4QSEeif\nCCY0R35Rg3cKZ4VCFxsjroNo1rWoJ1hF0Jy+R/KXgTIwET3KYTGra7Y+8zjobFmB\nTToUAk7kkf/2eH6JzHo7sfcV5xg6dJNzVptaH6SAhxIjCckNB47rG0GHxmIhI+zW\nzrYDHD6n1FF9JjSW+jDV\n=w7KW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6fa1d331288bf5dd158ebefeb96f734d4f058d4a\nparent 0390043a32136f34d787355f0f87a50a6f686a06\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783060202 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783060202 -0400\n\nchore(code): automatic PATH setup, snap-curl detection, and temp cleanup in install script (#4464)\n\nThe installer now actively fixes `dcode` PATH resolution instead of just\nwarning the user, detects snap-sandboxed `curl` that silently fails\ndownloads, and cleans up temp files on Ctrl-C without printing a\ncontradictory failure message.\n\n## Changes\n- **Automatic PATH setup** — `ensure_path_setup` symlinks the verified\nbinary into an existing PATH dir (`~/.local/bin`, `~/bin`, `~/.bin`); if\nnone are on PATH, creates `~/.local/bin`, symlinks there, and appends a\nPATH export to the detected shell profile (`.zshrc`, `.bashrc`,\n`.bash_profile`, `config.fish`). Prompts interactively before modifying\na profile, auto-adds in non-interactive mode, and skips entirely when\nuv's `~/.local/bin/env` already handles PATH.\n- **Snap `curl` detection** — `is_snap_curl` checks whether `curl` lives\nunder `/snap/`, in which case it has sandbox permission issues that\ncause silent download failures. `install_uv` and the new\n`download_to_stdout` helper fall back to `wget`, or emit a clear error\nif no working downloader exists.\n- **Interrupt-safe temp cleanup** — a `TEMP_FILES` registry\n(`register_temp` / `cleanup_temp_files`) tracks every `mktemp` so\nthey're removed on both normal exit and Ctrl-C. A dedicated\n`cleanup_on_interrupt` handler for INT/TERM disarms the EXIT trap first,\nso the user sees only \"Installation interrupted.\" rather than that\nfollowed by a contradictory \"Installation failed (exit code 1).\"\n- **`download_to_stdout` helper** — consolidates the duplicated\ncurl-or-wget logic from `install_uv` and `fetch_latest_version` into one\nfunction with snap detection built in.","verified_at":"2026-07-03T06:30:02Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/aa9ccc620133c325a72e552546d5d6ff10649407","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/aa9ccc620133c325a72e552546d5d6ff10649407","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/aa9ccc620133c325a72e552546d5d6ff10649407/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"0390043a32136f34d787355f0f87a50a6f686a06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0390043a32136f34d787355f0f87a50a6f686a06","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0390043a32136f34d787355f0f87a50a6f686a06"}]},{"sha":"0390043a32136f34d787355f0f87a50a6f686a06","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDAzOTAwNDNhMzIxMzZmMzRkNzg3MzU1ZjBmODdhNTBhNmY2ODZhMDY","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-03T06:29:35Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-03T06:29:35Z"},"message":"release(deepagents-code): 0.1.31 (#4424)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.31](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.30...deepagents-code==0.1.31)\n(2026-07-03)\n\n### Features\n\n* Collapse large pastes into compact placeholders\n([#4447](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4447))\n([9ae927d](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7))\n* Show model name instead of spec in switcher\n([#4460](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4460))\n([0059620](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/005962088ad31b16745c399e4ab2e725e97f7858))\n* Offer abort during resume\n([#4188](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4188))\n([a4c25cd](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a4c25cd74de9902fd0ea9440b5dda2d4248bb3d2))\n* Persistent banner when installation is stale\n([#4459](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4459))\n([b74c185](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a))\n* Show `\"Took <duration>\"` after `execute` finishes\n([#4301](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4301))\n([a5240eb](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a5240ebe3654e72fa5beb4070224f52f944768c8))\n* Unify `config show`/`list` around effective values\n([#4174](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4174))\n([ccd9d21](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Make execute command expandable in code TUI transcript\n([#4428](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4428))\n([d999181](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa))\n* Allow suppressing LangSmith key override warning\n([#4436](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4436))\n([ddcae5e](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ddcae5e0bd9aebc946be1d9fb3f5e35eeb690fa6))\n* Ensure unique message widget IDs on history load\n([#4454](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4454))\n([de2f7d2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/de2f7d2835485df905772e1c96e33d2c239d8e22))\n* Resolve `/threads` header link on mount, not after load\n([#4453](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4453))\n([4cba728](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4cba72893fc4aae5b429d8c573c1a513d97ddf8a))\n* Restore caller's LangSmith API key in shell subprocess env\n([#4458](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4458))\n([9293b19](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9293b190170a872b73d0d94e66479bcc5f7962c7))\n* Route Anthropic effort through output config\n([#4446](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4446))\n([1e8ed81](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1e8ed81940a862dde44f704826b61650336367e0))\n* Show loading state during model switch\n([#4209](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4209))\n([7cc4e9f](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7cc4e9f9bda5a8ae42bb072b82b634ad8c39ade1))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a00130faf3cfe482fb4e8a523bb715bfd743ae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/1a00130faf3cfe482fb4e8a523bb715bfd743ae8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/0390043a32136f34d787355f0f87a50a6f686a06","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqR1bPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3WYQAJ+Ts7yFqLiBqBwWAUvlpjjC\nwqyTuD1/LrdQLYSLVYImlfkzYA9S0CHpwkTYPg3+McFq3slqASPLDwFBzHp3WY7K\nakAqRmDvYf/qQZfTj24T3IMObOJoJagXQvIlakruD175DUyTZ8uRqxxLzSDwsQGd\nzP4HwhN74zi/1Vcp3Qua8aYlKriAJvLAD+gNvy86O3HeXTFKXNBOueBz6DJN6X0v\nPZg/Ss50cSj8eYsQgHd/HVYNdKKnmZikgG2lUO/+4fn055C2vC+eY+rPV