/4459))\n([b74c185](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a))\n* Show `\"Took <duration>\"` after `execute` finishes\n([#4301](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4301))\n([a5240eb](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a5240ebe3654e72fa5beb4070224f52f944768c8))\n* Unify `config show`/`list` around effective values\n([#4174](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4174))\n([ccd9d21](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Make execute command expandable in code TUI transcript\n([#4428](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4428))\n([d999181](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa))\n* Allow suppressing LangSmith key override warning\n([#4436](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4436))\n([ddcae5e](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ddcae5e0bd9aebc946be1d9fb3f5e35eeb690fa6))\n* Ensure unique message widget IDs on history load\n([#4454](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4454))\n([de2f7d2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/de2f7d2835485df905772e1c96e33d2c239d8e22))\n* Resolve `/threads` header link on mount, not after load\n([#4453](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4453))\n([4cba728](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4cba72893fc4aae5b429d8c573c1a513d97ddf8a))\n* Restore caller's LangSmith API key in shell subprocess env\n([#4458](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4458))\n([9293b19](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9293b190170a872b73d0d94e66479bcc5f7962c7))\n* Route Anthropic effort through output config\n([#4446](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4446))\n([1e8ed81](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1e8ed81940a862dde44f704826b61650336367e0))\n* Show loading state during model switch\n([#4209](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4209))\n([7cc4e9f](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7cc4e9f9bda5a8ae42bb072b82b634ad8c39ade1))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-03T06:29:36Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0390043a32136f34d787355f0f87a50a6f686a06","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0390043a32136f34d787355f0f87a50a6f686a06","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0390043a32136f34d787355f0f87a50a6f686a06/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"005962088ad31b16745c399e4ab2e725e97f7858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/005962088ad31b16745c399e4ab2e725e97f7858","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/005962088ad31b16745c399e4ab2e725e97f7858"}]},{"sha":"005962088ad31b16745c399e4ab2e725e97f7858","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDAwNTk2MjA4OGFkMzFiMTY3NDVjMzk5ZTRhYjJlNzI1ZTk3Zjc4NTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-03T06:13:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-03T06:13:02Z"},"message":"feat(code): show model name instead of spec in switcher (#4460)\n\nThe `/model` switcher now shows just the model name under each provider\nheader instead of the full `provider:model` string.\n\n---\n\nIn the `/model` selector (`libs/code`), provider-grouped rows rendered\nthe full `provider:model` spec even though each row sits under a header\nthat already names the provider. This shows just the model name for\nthose rows, reducing redundancy. A `show_provider_prefix` flag is\nthreaded through the label helpers and persisted on each `ModelOption`\nso incremental relabels in `_move_selection` stay consistent with the\nfull rebuild. The pinned \"Recent\" section keeps the full spec since it\nhas no provider header, and all selection/matching logic still keys off\nthe full spec.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/9a970f12-372e-9bdb-1fd6-57126025f5c2)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb2fefdc1c9ddd075bc2f747db139fea30f104b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/fb2fefdc1c9ddd075bc2f747db139fea30f104b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/005962088ad31b16745c399e4ab2e725e97f7858","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqR1LuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWhEQAGAsxT2L4TmcBKqJpYHqEYrS\nugfFhWjwQQG4ebc4qD9fCu/nuwTbF/AbqXS1x3yiWE/JUUI3kumN8zqxD14iDUvO\nGFeg1A+10OinrY9MnCxKuPwVZa6Qj7N8kGz/Gu/Q2hFC8qod9xzC6uZTSHFjBy2j\nVQa/sGtj9P6G4jBLOSX6V6tdHzlXJZZYYCbsbgXRkbXTJlzsctO2eKsCSZLRQgPd\nhXrSPnxdnTULnRDOiYN7UkqcJ67busu4Kc/xSoIftRN54LVnVgKF+zg89wJw629h\nDqZpSrz3KOavYDiO4KDGfaknXYIuSs6z52hHvocb65JoS49BiYfdRthht/J0sLdV\nN6FDlCnc4Q9/AWtRVloFGNS8t4XG5nXYgHvSBRAY1qPVRzE5r1zpXkuO861Cvho4\nHI1awFzkVeWK7ZlsonrNrTMT4sKiNC+c9WWXS4XPg3/4pmBebLPIGF9tA+/sFdez\ngNG15PyOBVWt5Nvf5Eowh5EsaAG71Ky751BSOw/51uB+M3/khSZi1WTDeK4Ylzmp\n6fkyRSAr1NlMQftzTfyRUWqJIrcPNSJFUHRu3TfOMbGsQjavptxWJrtikuSh+gcj\nyUIeGUqclFpTGZxJIYfVRRRMtddqKRAUP7HBhyBFSmNJnYIU+86FIYhQT+yocgBG\nhD8fNK8WLCq8quCLTfpl\n=xyI7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree fb2fefdc1c9ddd075bc2f747db139fea30f104b7\nparent ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783059182 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783059182 -0400\n\nfeat(code): show model name instead of spec in switcher (#4460)\n\nThe `/model` switcher now shows just the model name under each provider\nheader instead of the full `provider:model` string.\n\n---\n\nIn the `/model` selector (`libs/code`), provider-grouped rows rendered\nthe full `provider:model` spec even though each row sits under a header\nthat already names the provider. This shows just the model name for\nthose rows, reducing redundancy. A `show_provider_prefix` flag is\nthreaded through the label helpers and persisted on each `ModelOption`\nso incremental relabels in `_move_selection` stay consistent with the\nfull rebuild. The pinned \"Recent\" section keeps the full spec since it\nhas no provider header, and all selection/matching logic still keys off\nthe full spec.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/9a970f12-372e-9bdb-1fd6-57126025f5c2)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-03T06:13:03Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/005962088ad31b16745c399e4ab2e725e97f7858","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/005962088ad31b16745c399e4ab2e725e97f7858","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/005962088ad31b16745c399e4ab2e725e97f7858/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a"}]},{"sha":"ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGNjZDlkMjE2ZTc3ODU1YTI4Yjg4ODUwYmViNTI1ZjQ3Y2U4YjY4NmE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-03T04:07:30Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-03T04:07:30Z"},"message":"feat(code): unify `config show`/`list` around effective values (#4174)\n\n`dcode config show` now lists effective values and their source by\ndefault (with `list`/`ls` as aliases); use `--verbose` for option\ndescriptions and where to set each one.\n\n---\n\n`config list` previously printed a static catalog while `config show`\nprinted effective values — but in every comparable CLI (`git config\n--list`, `aws configure list`, `gcloud config list`, `npm config ls`)\n`list` means \"show effective values\", so the split defied expectations\nand the two views had unrelated formatting. This makes `config show` the\nsingle effective-value+source view (rendered as an aligned table, fixing\nthe manual `:<22` padding wobble), adds `-v/--verbose/--all` to fold in\ndescriptions + how-to-set, and makes `list`/`ls` an alias of `show`.\nCredential redaction is preserved and env/TOML values stay escaped.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"64c608d86d973fc49f6d9bc132f553510e5593c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/64c608d86d973fc49f6d9bc132f553510e5593c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRzWCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUaUQAK3HoxIjabpAuykZEx6eQkL+\n9U0xwNNcdUIksdddpofUNZpyzQdIm6Vr33NPDIHiEXxAwUAGgvA/LZLkjQm6apWz\n8+TGg8ueQRHndtAAFXiW4Xz9mz4IISR6Q+ox+8c5hGZPWzs3fL1Ud8qvZZ3fXeTP\nrp705jSlSdNPrVCgD5RcBJEaUhlIMtq9XryxPQNNMJsq6+RdlyxShYTvwJH5EDxi\nyYiGiACavGV8RoDRxcbPXoM8OkGRU5DUhgigOz/zTSFbAxv1ksK/n0w+7SZg6CJJ\ne4C5dVQhaWd6CmSERlVWIOcScP4KqkRZ+rNjOHrhJdV0Hnu51e7LU/Gp19lN9VBB\nkbXS6lTtYahyFhmGvHqLMUEbZqZGEYvXMRsgsQSjw9YNEV01V6g1z10FNcs/ENYB\nJwjk1E5XPO22NHpIrfGoNFwdp4zgNWYsASfJV3MFrLLjtOQXURCUCISO+dwPGlHE\n/O2IgfLy4Jj1BxR/lXANeo+utK2Nq3Ei0fExyPRQSmcGxn2Z13ry/s2YUQ10IJJu\nuxhdO1A1Za4p2h4GtdPJyBQ5UtwPDFysGqzq6dqmoTSkdLY+zOJ929jae5eJxYsN\n3HPztZPhZvGcyJhnTpZrRDMsi3DO/C2ey8CUcqNfEAKT9HntoPArAPLQbShCn273\nOE93wmaYTnjPVejDj8KB\n=CJY7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 64c608d86d973fc49f6d9bc132f553510e5593c8\nparent b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783051650 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783051650 -0400\n\nfeat(code): unify `config show`/`list` around effective values (#4174)\n\n`dcode config show` now lists effective values and their source by\ndefault (with `list`/`ls` as aliases); use `--verbose` for option\ndescriptions and where to set each one.\n\n---\n\n`config list` previously printed a static catalog while `config show`\nprinted effective values — but in every comparable CLI (`git config\n--list`, `aws configure list`, `gcloud config list`, `npm config ls`)\n`list` means \"show effective values\", so the split defied expectations\nand the two views had unrelated formatting. This makes `config show` the\nsingle effective-value+source view (rendered as an aligned table, fixing\nthe manual `:<22` padding wobble), adds `-v/--verbose/--all` to fold in\ndescriptions + how-to-set, and makes `list`/`ls` an alias of `show`.\nCredential redaction is preserved and env/TOML values stay escaped.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-03T04:07:31Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ccd9d216e77855a28b88850beb525f47ce8b686a/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a"}]},{"sha":"b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGI3NGMxODU5MWE4Y2U5YTQ5YTVmZWU0M2IwN2U2MDJjYTlmYmY2OGE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-03T03:45:00Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-03T03:45:00Z"},"message":"feat(code): persistent banner when installation is stale (#4459)\n\nDeep Agents Code now shows a persistent header banner when your\ninstalled version is more than two weeks old.\n\n---\n\nInforms users when their `dcode` installation is more than two weeks old\nby reusing the existing persistent header bar (`_StaticHeader`,\npreviously only shown behind `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_SHOW_HEADER` and used for\nthe sandbox indicator). When the installed version's release is `>= 14`\ndays old, the header is rendered even without the env var and its\nsubtitle carries an advisory that overrides the sandbox label. Install\nage is derived cache-only (no startup network calls), and the check is\nsuppressed for editable/dev installs and when update checks are\ndisabled.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/cca5fce9-67e0-cf5d-377f-d9acf912ed65)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/cca5fce9-67e0-cf5d-377f-d9acf912ed65/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fd59485a28ec4f9f7dcbb0f4c7144f611c1c0ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/1fd59485a28ec4f9f7dcbb0f4c7144f611c1c0ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRzA8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4/kQADjx4MGm2xiR25xc5YPDExxc\nlEZwb97EPCyoCZ8wusUbm9+UZBRfRA3YZnNErEc9oCSSd/EiHsX0sNm7wl0DA4eH\nQm/wzug1VhW/mMst0EVQpp8+FzASWpTw1IOhaEGdjBlVWaNJMaJ9kfk6PqZuGEcl\nuqvfIGC2vnqRKx+5OhJk4Ptbn1DUAu8b5rpb1AE+xro3wrmhcjANR3GbpB1ZtqEf\nRSWEKb2oHHTe1py+DwxWY513dwlcsH3633XjZZ5Sq0PwvFFazA19gxyomp+BSM+Z\nafGCvvZdQOU/uu/d/g60AEzOuwdfCS89zFO4VoM4o5Yq4FOO2yTa20KTRMRO2xYK\nW6GEddRh+JNZnzUZkjpoRJ8daS2Bazy9yojwlQTUKGYR6v4WrnfXh20g2RjmvGJD\nKU3e8M3RT2A9jtMM6QejG0hMtq/6SoNEuXYXH3hjt1usPMLhuLsK1LlT3RG8b/Yd\n7WB1eKQXKYXfu9fqItMxrFMQ9LliZXbapIvM5neb6n7g5ad2XNSS+SdI1E6ChzPf\ne8BysIWT20c0uopS2jsdIH/KEw2vufCaYzikvDSFVBaMO1M9a+RmwC0MQNkPs/UC\nB8qrEmBM3dpwucgWRrvDqfOAfyvTXE9BBXmj4lVxfYIsDOyhAsQ2r8ZBjucSYG9q\na+SufUpJu2D8LvXo135h\n=+yTZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 1fd59485a28ec4f9f7dcbb0f4c7144f611c1c0ee\nparent d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783050300 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783050300 -0400\n\nfeat(code): persistent banner when installation is stale (#4459)\n\nDeep Agents Code now shows a persistent header banner when your\ninstalled version is more than two weeks old.\n\n---\n\nInforms users when their `dcode` installation is more than two weeks old\nby reusing the existing persistent header bar (`_StaticHeader`,\npreviously only shown behind `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_SHOW_HEADER` and used for\nthe sandbox indicator). When the installed version's release is `>= 14`\ndays old, the header is rendered even without the env var and its\nsubtitle carries an advisory that overrides the sandbox label. Install\nage is derived cache-only (no startup network calls), and the check is\nsuppressed for editable/dev installs and when update checks are\ndisabled.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/cca5fce9-67e0-cf5d-377f-d9acf912ed65)\n\n## References\n- Plan:\nhttps://openswe.vercel.app/agents/cca5fce9-67e0-cf5d-377f-d9acf912ed65/plan\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-03T03:45:01Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b74c18591a8ce9a49a5fee43b07e602ca9fbf68a/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa"}]},{"sha":"d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGQ5OTkxODFlODQyNDQ5ODY4MWYxZTQ0MmM3MTM4MGJmNmI4MmIwYWE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-03T03:39:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-03T03:39:29Z"},"message":"fix(code): make execute command expandable in code TUI transcript (#4428)\n\nThe code TUI now lets you click a long `execute` command in the\ntranscript to expand and view it in full.\n\n---\n\nIn the `deepagents-code` TUI, long `execute` shell commands were\ntruncated at 120 chars in the transcript header with no way to see the\nfull text — clicking a row toggled the *output*, not the command. This\nadds a collapsible full-command block that mirrors the existing\n`js_eval` code block: clicking the command header (or its hint) expands\nthe full command, while clicking the output still toggles output.\n`on_click` is now region-aware so both the command and an expandable\noutput can each be toggled independently.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/de77dad1-3f8b-b84c-4d8e-553560c9db74)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"90f605ad203cd3c3288b2be8271e0e0491298294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/90f605ad203cd3c3288b2be8271e0e0491298294"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRy7xCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAJ0QAGkOr9E0oXEE6F809/7SUX6V\nf4Uyu1M5/TnptNjQx+Ntcq7V2xswu1lLI5kw/s4ogLv5twNzX+lgYo9vxRZH9s/Y\nSGHrJznFkzDmpXDt7GmL74RXapD7w64xtnbStmDMYq47D0lv3Upb6zXYRZSw429+\nPOI3f7FVZTPR6I8/2F5JskWkE4eGA8sg5yVtGjMXr9IJjKecHUtmDyGD3Mb61PAP\nrDievgEDZ6QZLThyb6a0E42q5k18+7xa+edJm1W+neE/MKMcPAdSBXCEDCtMt8In\nCX1vL2zU9alwzeFA3+4m83qjBzmr7lxPo3gGJhrGekB7j7P4634+P4hGmG8ITYaZ\njWu9HxqEecD6WzrCWuS0TEKxuExCSYQl6nU2xRzZgx9eOOkBjz6V95WjCZINGgCB\n2poeHe+9F3J87fIsJBC/Sb9dyNhPziMagInzOMDsuJ8KpkLiGSD2L0Bfq/kVdCXJ\n/LDjJMZsMB6OwqsPuVLI3kNINAy/9LVGtLrK9+gHEd6M7tmRLZQT5xWcEQdZi0LK\n1HG7U+lKYIhYT0JxAmBrfyqZ1YwD/yYimsk9Vx/Q9kf4depvSLKc65axAslYTmHL\n9G6yw2tEsDfXl9B60JDqs2AT03nAO+TmP2HqgBCtK809OAbqEtj2U3QXpaZOE5JN\nW95wBrqzHcc9SBLTDd4/\n=p3+X\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 90f605ad203cd3c3288b2be8271e0e0491298294\nparent 9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783049969 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783049969 -0400\n\nfix(code): make execute command expandable in code TUI transcript (#4428)\n\nThe code TUI now lets you click a long `execute` command in the\ntranscript to expand and view it in full.\n\n---\n\nIn the `deepagents-code` TUI, long `execute` shell commands were\ntruncated at 120 chars in the transcript header with no way to see the\nfull text — clicking a row toggled the *output*, not the command. This\nadds a collapsible full-command block that mirrors the existing\n`js_eval` code block: clicking the command header (or its hint) expands\nthe full command, while clicking the output still toggles output.\n`on_click` is now region-aware so both the command and an expandable\noutput can each be toggled independently.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/de77dad1-3f8b-b84c-4d8e-553560c9db74)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-03T03:39:30Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d999181e8424498681f1e442c71380bf6b82b0aa/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7"}]},{"sha":"9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDlhZTkyN2Q3M2ViZjMwYmE1MGJiYjdlYzBjMTA3NmEwOTM3ZTVjYjc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Johannes du Plessis","email":"johannes@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-03T03:11:22Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-03T03:11:22Z"},"message":"feat(code): collapse large pastes into compact placeholders (#4447)\n\nLarge pastes (>800 chars or >2 newlines) are collapsed into a `[Pasted\ntext #N +M lines]` placeholder in the input box. At submission the\nplaceholder is expanded back to full text so the agent receives the\ncomplete content. Rendered user messages over 10,000 chars are truncated\nto head+tail (2,500 each) with an elision marker, matching Claude Code's\nbehaviour.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **`paste_collapse.py`** (new) — threshold constants, `PastedContent`\ndataclass, `should_collapse_paste`, `format_paste_ref`,\n`parse_paste_refs`, `expand_paste_refs`\n- **`ChatTextArea`** — new `PastedText` message; `_on_paste` and\n`_flush_paste_burst` intercept large pastes before Textual inserts them\n- **`ChatInput`** — stores paste content, inserts placeholder, expands\nat submit, cleans up orphaned content on delete, expands for clipboard\ncopy\n- **`UserMessage` / `QueuedUserMessage`** — `_truncate_for_display()`\nrenders head+tail with elision marker for messages over 10k chars; full\ntext preserved in `_content` for copy/select\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d5425ed-d953-41f7-a898-0520610dd711\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"dc4e57a676ffe0fa50d52a25a1353262a0b06d1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/dc4e57a676ffe0fa50d52a25a1353262a0b06d1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRyhaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYAoQAKntMyeW5AHrqKOTpnyrCKve\ngbHBEAAMOulQ7+5uvXbzcLrruocNcUiOqSB8BkKzbAmldZoXCrO5nCQeU0SKHgye\nZ5f58R5STJIty9coN1QAk8ETcu6Xc93KX88BqTiXqsIPcHV4sRQl+W1IUzZuefXy\nmL0WrNiUHVcFcmXJB+GM2DABYbJbZwCdgV/W66OJU2uuq5iPYc/I4oJjcV1x/GrM\nAHktcLGmvgURgbXEP3yS8uBt921iIG5lg9GDq5n3C9mev5HGRuZ2/9ZBRIzSIK/a\nL9oNW1wM0vIcjvC+tHSo89CmfRG1tfMPrSlVhnn61leu7e+ySTK+hZPS+iNNCX3c\nGUcMxui+UGgH4s0sTpbRDg2QDKuBkmFaM8ixcE9LcMKGebbewsn9yBgzaRDsZDXz\nUD8ssD+0O/65Nxn3es9MLFVGF6WBEOmw4PYBxVTX+TSMuSRaGppqFSvstXCBvv98\nzrk2cJ76lPVsAXbhe5Zb/BJN43H/G3PGkrKGMn551xhcOpiVSZgAvgLjogo0Vdty\nMLh1G21hmzfll+vYuBSxwjAXNFKxT7vaaJ2l6agHUzwqYoSuUcUhHuHmyE1+OEqh\nAkCkmVadiBO2DkJAtEp/wfgemCoJh2OF3baoHp6JKs3MEu9Y4xak5Y7KnuPhv/q2\nln/9khLdhIqJ2ZGyK1af\n=kFWq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree dc4e57a676ffe0fa50d52a25a1353262a0b06d1b\nparent 56c5a5e0e64cabe5fbe27308d3ddfd8a8fd9eb22\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1783048282 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783048282 -0400\n\nfeat(code): collapse large pastes into compact placeholders (#4447)\n\nLarge pastes (>800 chars or >2 newlines) are collapsed into a `[Pasted\ntext #N +M lines]` placeholder in the input box. At submission the\nplaceholder is expanded back to full text so the agent receives the\ncomplete content. Rendered user messages over 10,000 chars are truncated\nto head+tail (2,500 each) with an elision marker, matching Claude Code's\nbehaviour.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **`paste_collapse.py`** (new) — threshold constants, `PastedContent`\ndataclass, `should_collapse_paste`, `format_paste_ref`,\n`parse_paste_refs`, `expand_paste_refs`\n- **`ChatTextArea`** — new `PastedText` message; `_on_paste` and\n`_flush_paste_burst` intercept large pastes before Textual inserts them\n- **`ChatInput`** — stores paste content, inserts placeholder, expands\nat submit, cleans up orphaned content on delete, expands for clipboard\ncopy\n- **`UserMessage` / `QueuedUserMessage`** — `_truncate_for_display()`\nrenders head+tail with elision marker for messages over 10k chars; full\ntext preserved in `_content` for copy/select\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d5425ed-d953-41f7-a898-0520610dd711\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-07-03T03:11:22Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9ae927d73ebf30ba50bbb7ec0c1076a0937e5cb7/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u