351da8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fa5e8b91d6d3284cf2480777a2b2e79548351da8/comments","author":{"login":"jacoblee93","id":6952323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTIzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6952323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93","html_url":"https://github.com/jacoblee93","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacoblee93/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"6ee0ac4cca998f84e157187d565084e2a1912626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6ee0ac4cca998f84e157187d565084e2a1912626","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6ee0ac4cca998f84e157187d565084e2a1912626"}]},{"sha":"6ee0ac4cca998f84e157187d565084e2a1912626","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDZlZTBhYzRjY2E5OThmODRlMTU3MTg3ZDU2NTA4NGUyYTE5MTI2MjY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Johannes du Plessis","email":"johannes@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-01T20:11:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-01T20:11:51Z"},"message":"feat(code): add reasoning effort selector (#4403)\n\nCloses #3491\n\n---\n\nAdds a `/effort` slash command for configuring reasoning effort on the\ncurrent model. The command resolves provider/model-specific effort\nlevels, applies the selected effort through the existing per-session\nmodel-params override path, and rejects unsupported levels for the\nactive model.\n\nThe bare `/effort` command opens an interactive selector matching the\nexisting modal selector UX. Users can also pass an effort level\ndirectly, or clear/reset the per-session effort override. The active\neffort is shown next to the model in the status label and updates when\nthe effort is set, cleared, or the model is switched.\n\nThis also fixes provider credential switching so gateway-provisioned\ncustom auth headers, such as `ANTHROPIC_CUSTOM_HEADERS`, are cleared\nwhen returning to a provider-native key and endpoint.\n\n## Release note\n\nUsers can now configure supported reasoning effort levels with `/effort`\nand see the active effort displayed next to the current model. Switching\nback to a provider-native credential now clears gateway custom-header\nauth for supported providers.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a347939-b5e8-4fb6-bd0d-c50635017593\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"0735e407fb13d0f52b43a67718b060051571b2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/0735e407fb13d0f52b43a67718b060051571b2d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/6ee0ac4cca998f84e157187d565084e2a1912626","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRXSHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARKUQAEkgyVc+Y81tv7fzKx3qoGlL\ntR+ya6a2BGvSDAEM1QRycRdx9eFQejzKyKkpJZv5Y6U6dty416c2ykgn1W2l80XN\nu51iR+BwzZ0LfIawEfN5w13meIWiW8PU+qHU65M3UOey2vywqHN6b0qpaRfjViWY\n2AKh1JNqL1dIyhmV4DPOWMdLDIgdw0/Kj9py3KiToYHLwdDxyn8ahfPJ+X+GmGT9\njTl2YzyFFa2hZfZ0vyRjxBwsLngOAImmKXifAwOKdmV/+/X8k6+kyoUtXgMDr9CE\neBXQlyBpwCfuPzJsXXRWUwDRyGbAFJldUhMIxB6nqVZEiLsQ7JvvI02SY1wuaQAR\nlfOjhfiqOGR3I3fFs/kLzY3T2hjbxQ6Zl2HkqNyVph7dayafcyKjO5RfJUMxIilz\nWX+S2ZVuz66wMfANWZDIPvoj+7B3gEFlK1ZxkQXnDv1e9Y/Dy0s7fvlRbawzljJ2\n18EkJKaRoRU10wpqt430keuT1QKwyxjpQ1cCraSGUpn5eBPdr1Q8iC6NyHem/N2y\n260bX1U6Qn9mhCUsWV7eukvLLz8BtpA5KrkaPbB2EPjF6U7qBMNcUbl2sVSzultC\nbJhJWr/P73XElnf08qmegTdHXP/M47ufENO3QRetHyJkivsuzQIP6ZMjy0CCh2ZA\nZ8tnCLpQqFl6UIDcvWnu\n=DxDi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 0735e407fb13d0f52b43a67718b060051571b2d5\nparent ef637f4a3f38ee155ad7d31e64a5cdd7bfaee62c\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1782936711 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782936711 -0400\n\nfeat(code): add reasoning effort selector (#4403)\n\nCloses #3491\n\n---\n\nAdds a `/effort` slash command for configuring reasoning effort on the\ncurrent model. The command resolves provider/model-specific effort\nlevels, applies the selected effort through the existing per-session\nmodel-params override path, and rejects unsupported levels for the\nactive model.\n\nThe bare `/effort` command opens an interactive selector matching the\nexisting modal selector UX. Users can also pass an effort level\ndirectly, or clear/reset the per-session effort override. The active\neffort is shown next to the model in the status label and updates when\nthe effort is set, cleared, or the model is switched.\n\nThis also fixes provider credential switching so gateway-provisioned\ncustom auth headers, such as `ANTHROPIC_CUSTOM_HEADERS`, are cleared\nwhen returning to a provider-native key and endpoint.\n\n## Release note\n\nUsers can now configure supported reasoning effort levels with `/effort`\nand see the active effort displayed next to the current model. Switching\nback to a provider-native credential now clears gateway custom-header\nauth for supported providers.\n\n## Video\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a347939-b5e8-4fb6-bd0d-c50635017593\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-07-01T20:11:52Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6ee0ac4cca998f84e157187d565084e2a1912626","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6ee0ac4cca998f84e157187d565084e2a1912626","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6ee0ac4cca998f84e157187d565084e2a1912626/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ef637f4a3f38ee155ad7d31e64a5cdd7bfaee62c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ef637f4a3f38ee155ad7d31e64a5cdd7bfaee62c","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ef637f4a3f38ee155ad7d31e64a5cdd7bfaee62c"}]},{"sha":"ef637f4a3f38ee155ad7d31e64a5cdd7bfaee62c","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGVmNjM3ZjRhM2YzOGVlMTU1YWQ3ZDMxZTY0YTVjZGQ3YmZhZWU2MmM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-01T19:14:12Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-01T19:14:12Z"},"message":"fix(code): honest MCP OAuth callback close message (#4410)\n\nFixed the MCP OAuth callback page so it no longer falsely claims the\nbrowser tab will close automatically.\n\n---\n\nThe MCP OAuth loopback callback page told users \"This tab will close\nautomatically\", but the flow launches the browser via\n`webbrowser.open()` — an OS-opened tab, not a script-opened\n`window.open` window — so browser security policy refuses\n`window.close()` and the tab stays open with a misleading message. This\nkeeps the best-effort close (still works for the rare script-opened\ncase) and updates the wording to tell the user they can close the tab\nand return to their terminal.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/1ae8b968-6cc9-edda-8a81-4c506c40bfc4)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7c41391adac2e3cb430f228f7bf5fa3409bd004","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/d7c41391adac2e3cb430f228f7bf5fa3409bd004"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ef637f4a3f38ee155ad7d31e64a5cdd7bfaee62c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRWcECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0zIQAI8HHEIufgwf0IpdpkME/tTx\nFB/DmZB/+DQtz68f1EJIgW2+3OTtFLTTawW4cZV11Gsp4B/0/x1mFEng2CFwCTYd\nF9M0cZvWIsYXM/Fn4mLKahpD7LAaco561vLzILYEFaFNGoHnI3+FMd02FhLaHW1d\nA5VGZ0LiLPoZwLegn/kctrEfBV1FPKdaLOBat8CfuPGwcIE5KGQcEPMbepYIcEPR\nPP2KYmO1dRc2BBs2xNNTeInbCmVPAdqYigP5Xb5ZBU8YMWycBdmCjj5nmgrQQNFm\na4jMD/V6oDCcygDJAP6Kt9idXDG5pI6VH5CnNuQfyCNWRC0+ycg5wNImZvX4wpMe\ntu1o8qyVaQ8ENTW2JRj9wGoZac3ZbIOrzWSXn4L1bablmqcnmejV2K0GMn4g5QP/\n9Y8rClzBhP1BrjasA0VLWMpd0d2vtE1GBDz/ljEaWcS54nCoNSJ5HtR4EYhxBSDa\ndX1UuUUUJ7EzH0AIEy7Jq+5y/61WErXrnBDX5QyXSVmTiteCVo7f0Xu/GNZJ7AUY\nf1y+8IJ1ho0Chs9ZQmaUK+Wfvc8sLbL7arGBYz0wygFP5er9W+mZ/tQAyJLXBCWU\n9o03MG5SPBvKHaKLIyWwhmRo1ycay2hRL8SrDFihYo01abffRzDFRFFDk37WfLSN\nZi3jN7Mag0xtMpDPE/bE\n=x36W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree d7c41391adac2e3cb430f228f7bf5fa3409bd004\nparent e355213eb031c68044b91df5080a4b5b2b232c05\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782933252 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782933252 -0400\n\nfix(code): honest MCP OAuth callback close message (#4410)\n\nFixed the MCP OAuth callback page so it no longer falsely claims the\nbrowser tab will close automatically.\n\n---\n\nThe MCP OAuth loopback callback page told users \"This tab will close\nautomatically\", but the flow launches the browser via\n`webbrowser.open()` — an OS-opened tab, not a script-opened\n`window.open` window — so browser security policy refuses\n`window.close()` and the tab stays open with a misleading message. This\nkeeps the best-effort close (still works for the rare script-opened\ncase) and updates the wording to tell the user they can close the tab\nand return to their terminal.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/1ae8b968-6cc9-edda-8a81-4c506c40bfc4)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-01T19:14:12Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ef637f4a3f38ee155ad7d31e64a5cdd7bfaee62c","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ef637f4a3f38ee155ad7d31e64a5cdd7bfaee62c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ef637f4a3f38ee155ad7d31e64a5cdd7bfaee62c/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e355213eb031c68044b91df5080a4b5b2b232c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e355213eb031c68044b91df5080a4b5b2b232c05","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e355213eb031c68044b91df5080a4b5b2b232c05"}]},{"sha":"e355213eb031c68044b91df5080a4b5b2b232c05","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGUzNTUyMTNlYjAzMWM2ODA0NGI5MWRmNTA4MGE0YjViMmIyMzJjMDU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-01T15:56:52Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-01T15:56:52Z"},"message":"ci(repo): link SDK pin warnings to release tags (#4411)\n\nSDK pin warning comments now make the pinned `deepagents` version\nclickable, pointing reviewers directly at the matching GitHub release\ntag. That keeps prerelease/stale-pin review context one click away from\nthe advisory comment.\n\n## Changes\n- Build a GitHub release-tag URL for the currently pinned\n`deepagents==<version>` value in the SDK pin warning workflow.\n- Render the pin as a Markdown link in stale-pin and prerelease-pin\nwarning comments.\n- Add coverage that checks the workflow’s embedded `github-script`\ncontract links the pin to the encoded release tag and interpolates that\nlink into warning bodies.","tree":{"sha":"e20f606b85973f33db8b8aadf62efa73b66d2d29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/e20f606b85973f33db8b8aadf62efa73b66d2d29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/e355213eb031c68044b91df5080a4b5b2b232c05","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRTjECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuGgQAKQbx3YP0qZlvPAUAmUdXKM5\n16FJb2v9ijGdYGu1NqyXccfWj86qkLPokiq+IKsEW3JEMfneV3pv47+afEAnCtWX\nt08LwV+oFcYhAgpFIWjFyt3dlF8RvayLjj8SlHU5bH9UiRRM/a3kU8crhgVC5zSK\nOmCOUawAO44cKeHIL6AOjtcepcXoCn/OtM7lvsYBj2byfGJgv/DHLtPBOSeuDmx7\n4aFuAQL09G8nXkaCV4BI3k8+gHSm/EzvBUM5KH1oiN8VQfxoqxiVsGp5c4S2xC62\nSiYrR9uGt+Cu1/U/Tn5CqPlf8etCM1F+BaN9JIe8x4qHvtxFsJUy8lNYDUQUJX4B\nNDA+ukIF7i6h3sgKYdtkot4byK8itnEhHOZOUCiKKNln1a9Q4CaPORxjA2GC35of\ngWwl9OclMPWQCOD/eLNnjhFZMKYB+EjlqVbRiby+79oOcNdJUT0f8dZEngzSbXB/\nk5EqtLd/wkXDyj720zqIN7+XXaqId0CIx7VWd8sL6lP4/DMy06Kw5ebnj5PMa7Mp\nUrd88h9LzCTRoOQz4Oz2+oQUQSYkdM429HHj1WqlTJMaJtdSnjyPpGRgk1eQH/tM\npUlcQyF8h5YcxL4CcXrBR0+cGR47HOOR86a66g/5yAjp1Y5NaLY1gI3T4+cVPxBf\n3pK/UenFcB8EucLUhU5v\n=BrgD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e20f606b85973f33db8b8aadf62efa73b66d2d29\nparent e9b60dbb5f67fd72a18011bf0f7c59c5b237cf6c\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782921412 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782921412 -0400\n\nci(repo): link SDK pin warnings to release tags (#4411)\n\nSDK pin warning comments now make the pinned `deepagents` version\nclickable, pointing reviewers directly at the matching GitHub release\ntag. That keeps prerelease/stale-pin review context one click away from\nthe advisory comment.\n\n## Changes\n- Build a GitHub release-tag URL for the currently pinned\n`deepagents==<version>` value in the SDK pin warning workflow.\n- Render the pin as a Markdown link in stale-pin and prerelease-pin\nwarning comments.\n- Add coverage that checks the workflow’s embedded `github-script`\ncontract links the pin to the encoded release tag and interpolates that\nlink into warning bodies.","verified_at":"2026-07-01T15:56:52Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e355213eb031c68044b91df5080a4b5b2b232c05","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e355213eb031c68044b91df5080a4b5b2b232c05","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e355213eb031c68044b91df5080a4b5b2b232c05/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ