url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c540098728dfed7927699ac762ebd9d714941aea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c540098728dfed7927699ac762ebd9d714941aea","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c540098728dfed7927699ac762ebd9d714941aea"}]},{"sha":"c540098728dfed7927699ac762ebd9d714941aea","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGM1NDAwOTg3MjhkZmVkNzkyNzY5OWFjNzYyZWJkOWQ3MTQ5NDFhZWE","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-01T08:06:15Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-01T08:06:15Z"},"message":"release(deepagents-code): 0.1.29 (#4388)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.29](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.28...deepagents-code==0.1.29)\n(2026-07-01)\n\n### Features\n\n* Add rubric iteration controls\n([#4405](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4405))\n([d6692a7](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d6692a7c713490f170b17510d613e02ee37574ab))\n* Add Claude Sonnet 5 to model picker\n([#4386](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4386))\n([64758dd](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/64758dddf8b46c5b68c345fb1eac1fb7bcbf7f7e))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Full-width chat messages, hide scrollbar, flush input bg\n([#4374](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4374))\n([1f8e8dc](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1f8e8dc942ac54c4014ac48f9345ee0201be0b1b))\n* Resolve editable SDK version metadata\n([#4394](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4394))\n([3239bf4](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3239bf4edf2be3037bb18315463ac6a0c3537e5c))\n* Unblock MCP force reconnect modal\n([#4396](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4396))\n([8b7eab0](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/8b7eab023db686f577d16f4f9ac872205baf136f))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"afe76ab2a3b305daa6ed51142e45e28eff928630","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/afe76ab2a3b305daa6ed51142e45e28eff928630"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/c540098728dfed7927699ac762ebd9d714941aea","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRMp3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZXwQAHxRp2bl8Oyh31VIPveHS1Js\nv5lF8M553bhQ3skOzpHK3RnWIG8ic9OOc0ElUZpB4Igo8xF2cM2b+3JpFRdaQFQU\nBBx0YpM3T1MXkKLlJKxNrSt7I5yeubaTAmzjCBxF3kcb/lrjxYr6Z4UGS+7NIiTY\ndLN9qGh/L4+Qxg852eS48qFsVsO85TmmMBgw6S0e8wwEdsDm6pmPqnCLuMkLUVj6\nUJ8mYkz+axm6uXWVcWNHJGWe8PnYCg1VNaVq9nK8jrmIW/73lX2S6RVwjJ4uvKPd\nomDbDWrvfMwpqy/056TxiKBq9EEWWHWw1WdXWnG6RQdyE5lpyqZQTE1QRCL5/JSd\nGXUyUyCTD9UqElCOaLIKaC8ALJbDsDUEzcINMfh9f/gEAFKG0Xr68vl04e8erZ+1\nxuuzODGqsVcKshOlV7jeago+1tUmFj+x+jAYv6zRKWdNiYXuxbEYtXweVY0szuCh\nYBL07FtYSSH